    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The power of the moon fills you, granting you the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Improved Lunar Radiance.</strong> Once per turn, you can deal an extra 2d10 Radiant damage to a target you hit with an attack of a Wild Shape form.</p><p><strong>Shared Moonlight.</strong> Whenever you use Moonlight Step, you can also teleport one willing creature within 10 feet of you to an unoccupied space you can see within 10 feet of your destination.</p>",
